Third-party work included in rdui
---------------------------------

Ready (https://github.com/GollyGang/ready), GPL-3.0
  rdui reads Ready's formula language and .vti pattern files, and follows its stencils. The
  Phyllotaxis rule (src/rule.ts) is ported from Ready's Pennybacker2013 kernel, after
  Pennybacker & Newell (2013). Some bundled patterns and seeds (patterns/ready, public/vti)
  derive from Ready's pattern collection.

Colour maps (src/colormaps.ts), via Ready's maps and Enki's colour map atlas:
  - ColorBrewer (Cynthia A. Brewer, Mark Harrower and The Pennsylvania State University),
    Apache License 2.0, https://colorbrewer2.org
  - inferno (Nathaniel J. Smith, Stefan van der Walt and Eric Firing, matplotlib), CC0
  - terrain (matplotlib), matplotlib license
  - CET Perceptually Uniform Colour Maps (Peter Kovesi), CC BY 4.0, https://colorcet.com

mp4-muxer (Vanilagy), MIT License, bundled into the built app for video export.
